  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Balaji Krishnan vs Food Safety Officer on 16 June, 2015 Author: B. Kemal Pasha Bench: B.Kemal Pasha In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present: The Honourable Mr. Justice B.Kemal Pasha Monday, The 5Th Day Of February 2018 / 16Th Magha, 1939 Crl.MC.No. 3248 of 2017 --------------------- Cc 2493/2016 of Judicial First Class Magistrate Court, Kodungallur ------- Petitioners/Accused Nos. 2 & 3 : -------------------------------- 1 Balaji Krishnan Nominee Of M/S.Parry Agro Industries Ltd., P.B.No. 521, Kochi - 682 003. 2 M/S. Parry Agro Industries Ltd. P.B.No. 521, Kochi - 682 003, Represented By Nominee Balaji Krishnan. By Adv.Sri.N.A.Muraleedharan Respondents/Complainant & State : --------------------------------- 1. Food Safety Officer Kodungallur Circle, Kodungallur - 680 644. 2. Commissioner Of Food Safety For The State Of Kerala, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695 001. 3. Food Safety And Standard Authority Of India, Ministry Of Health And Family Welfare, Government Of India, Regional Office, 1St Floor, Marine Building, North End, Willingdon Island, Kochi - 682 001. Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/168991632/ 1 4. State Of Kerala Represented By The Secretary, Department Of Health And Welfare, Government Of Kerala, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695 001, Through Public Prosecutor, High Court Of Kerala, Ernakulam - 682 031. R1,R2 & R4 Public Prosecutor Sri. T.R.Renjith This Criminal Misc. Case Having Been Finally Heard On 05-02-2018, The Court On The Same Day Passed The Following: bp Crl.MC.No. 3248 of 2017 () -------------------------- Appendix Petitioner(S)' Annexures : ----------------------- Annexure A1 Certified Copy Of The Complaint In C.C.No.2493 Of 2016 Of The Judicial First Class Magistrate Court, Kodungallur. Annexure A2 Certified Copy Of Form B Report No. 19/2015-16 Dated 16.06.2015 Of The Food Analyst. Annexure A3 Certified Copy Of The Certificate Of The Referral Laboratory. Annexure A4 True Photocopy Of The Sanction Order No. De-3963/2016/Cfs Dated 21.07.2016 Of The 2Nd Respondent. Annexure A5 True Photocopy Of Order Dated 19.05.2016 Issued By The Central Government Through The Food Safety And Standard Authority Of India (Fssai) Annexure A6 True Photocopy Of Relevant Pages (Front Page, Page 1,2, 51 To 53) Of Extract Of Fssai Manual Of Methods Of Analysis Of Foods By The Food Safety And Standard Laboratory Of Relating To The Test Methods Of Iron Filing In Tea. Annexure A7 True Photocopy Of Relevant Pages (Front Page, Page 23 & 24) Of Dghs Lab Manual-4 Relating To The Test Method Of Iron Filing In Tea. Respondent'S Annexures : Nil.",
    "facts": "In this case, prosecution has been launched for non- conformance of iron fillings in the year 2015.",
